<title>SWEDEN: Saab to give news with BAe, Hungary.</title>
<headline>Saab to give news with BAe, Hungary.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Saab AB's Gripen jet fighter marketing unit Saab-BA Gripen AB said on Monday it would hold a news conference on Wednesday, January 22 with British Aerospace Plc and Hungary's Industry Ministry.</p>
<p>The press conference will be held at 1015 GMT in Stockholm, Saab AB said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1017</p>
</text>
